# UX workflow: record undoable sequencer actions on two tracks, then undo them
# while staying on the current track and showing the affected track in the
# transient history toast.
# Purpose: validates centralized sequencer history across tracks without
# automatic navigation jumps.
# Expect: capture_changed:t02_step_on=t02_step_off_after_toast, capture_changed:t01_step_on=t01_step_off_verified

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen initial_t01

# Action A on Track 1: enable step 1.
150 tap MACRO_1 60
350 capture screen t01_step_on

# Switch navigation focus from page to track, then create/select Track 2.
450 tap NAV 60
650 encoder NAV 1
850 capture screen t02_add_preview
950 tap NAV 60
1250 capture screen t02_created

# Action B on Track 2: enable step 1.
1350 tap MACRO_1 60
1550 capture screen t02_step_on

# Undo B. The visible track stays T02 and the toast identifies T02.
1650 button LEFT_CENTER down
2650 tick
2700 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2850 capture screen undo_t02_toast
2950 button LEFT_CENTER up
4300 capture screen t02_step_off_after_toast

# Undo A. The visible track still stays T02, but the toast identifies T01.
4400 button LEFT_CENTER down
5400 tick
5450 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5600 capture screen undo_t01_toast
5700 button LEFT_CENTER up
7050 capture screen still_t02_after_t01_undo

# Navigate back to Track 1 to verify the hidden-track undo actually applied.
7150 encoder NAV -1
7350 capture screen t01_step_off_verified
